    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28270" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρᾰκοντίας</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρός, ὁ,</span> a
		wheat <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with coarse straw,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.21.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πελειάς, ἡ,</span> a kind of <i>pigeon,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				73
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. σίκυς,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἄγριος</span>
			, Euthyd. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.74b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>stone found in a serpent's head,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				37.158
			</span></i>.</div>
